    "PPTX 无表头属性",
    "DOCX 分页仅在 lastRenderedPageBreak 存在时可见",
    "work_used.chars counts cell text only, not footnote text (footnotes are bounded separately by max_footnote_chars)",
    "when a:tblGrid / w:tblGrid is absent, grid.columns is null and span overflow cannot be judged, so no diagnostic is emitted",
